  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Choosing a Favorite Snack</h2>\n<p>The character is asked to choose a favorite snack, but the other person ignores the question.</p>\n<h2>Invincibility and Black Holes</h2>\n<p>The character questions whether being invincible would prevent death even if falling into a black hole, but the other person does not agree.</p>\n<h2>End of the Game Story</h2>\n<p>The character asks if the game&#x27;s story is over, but suddenly the game ends, and the character is eliminated.</p>\n<h2>Time Travel and Game Replay</h2>\n<p>The character suggests that time travel could allow replaying the game, but the sense of accomplishment from completing it is still achieved.</p>\n<h2>Memories of Home</h2>\n<p>The character recalls a time when they were away from home and looking at the stars.</p>\n<h2>Mother&#x27;s Presence and Memories</h2>\n<p>A mother&#x27;s presence is always felt, even after loss, and memories of loved ones can be cherished.</p>\n<h2>Comfort and Loneliness</h2>\n<p>The speaker finds comfort in reminders of their mother, leading to sadness and a feeling of loneliness.</p>\n<h2>Transformation into a Comet</h2>\n<p>The speaker transforms into a comet to help others on a journey.</p>\n<h2>Luma&#x27;s Transformation</h2>\n<p>Luma transforms into a comet.</p>\n<h2>Luma&#x27;s Transformation Ability</h2>\n<p>Lumas have the ability to transform into various celestial objects.</p>\n<h2>Desire to Bring Joy</h2>\n<p>The speaker desires to become a star that brings joy to others.</p>\n<h2>Adorable Transformation</h2>\n<p>The speaker finds the comet transformation adorable.</p>\n<h2>Encouragement to Stop Crying</h2>\n<p>The Lumas collectively encourage the speaker to stop crying.</p>\n<h2>Confusion About Galaxy 2</h2>\n<p>The speaker is confused about Galaxy 2 and its availability.</p>\n<h2>Super Mario Galaxy and 3D All-Stars</h2>\n<p>The speaker is playing Super Mario Galaxy and referencing the Super Mario 3D All-Stars collection.</p>\n<h2>Availability of Galaxy 2</h2>\n<p>Galaxy 2 is available on the Nintendo Switch.</p>\n<h2>Completion of Super Mario Galaxy Segment</h2>\n<p>The speaker has completed a segment of Super Mario Galaxy and is promoting the upcoming Blue World release.</p>\n<h2>Request to Watch Blue World</h2>\n<p>The speaker requests viewers to watch and stream the Blue World release.</p>\n<h2>Gratitude and Enjoyment</h2>\n<p>The speaker expresses gratitude for the effort put into the video and shares their enjoyment of playing.</p>\n<h2>Interest in Super Mario Sunshine</h2>\n<p>The speaker expresses interest in playing Super Mario Sunshine and indicates uncertainty about the next playthrough.</p>\n<h2>Thank You and Schedule Uncertainty</h2>\n<p>The speaker thanks viewers for joining and acknowledges scheduling uncertainty.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gYg3rX9-d68</p>",
