      "text": "Off we go!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7535,
      "text": "Whoa."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7536,
      "text": "We're blasting off."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7557,
      "text": "She's awesome."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7559,
      "text": "There is a Warfield."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7562,
      "text": "Go!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7563,
      "text": "They're inside!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7563,
      "text": "Hurry!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7566,
      "text": "Okay, why was that not voiced?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 7578,
      "text": "I was like, oh, I can turn the reverb off."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8344,
      "text": "He hates this!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8364,
      "text": "Oh god."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8375,
      "text": "One more?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8376,
      "text": "Or is that it?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8377,
      "text": "Just Mario, just standing there."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8400,
      "text": "Idling."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8401,
      "text": "Is he okay?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8409,
      "text": "He'll be fine."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8878,
      "text": "I don't know."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8879,
      "text": "I feel like that's a lie."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8885,
      "text": "I feel like it's- it's like the Luigi is real."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8889,
      "text": "You remember from like Mario 64?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8892,
      "text": "And everyone's like, if you do these things, you unlock Luigi, you could play as Luigi."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8896,
      "text": "That's what this sounds like."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8902,
      "text": "I can't tell."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8903,
      "text": "You guys like to lie."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8904,
      "text": "You guys like to lie for fun."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8917,
      "text": "We're gonna do more stars."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8919,
      "text": "But also, while we're going through the credits,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8923,
      "text": "we are currently working towards 1 million subscribers."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8935,
      "text": "You might think you're already subscribed, but you might not actually be."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8938,
      "text": "So be sure to check."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8940,
      "text": "Take a look right now."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8944,
      "text": "And once I do, eventually stop streaming."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8949,
      "text": "Please leave a comment."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8953,
      "text": "And high five, gang!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8961,
      "text": "You can really play as Luigi."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8963,
      "text": "No lie."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8963,
      "text": "I'm gonna look it up."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8976,
      "text": "No spoilers."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8977,
      "text": "Look it up."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 8981,
      "text": "You can."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9155,
      "text": "Okay, then."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9167,
      "text": "What's the point to be being able to play as Luigi though,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9171,
      "text": "if you've already done everything?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9183,
      "text": "Choosing a favorite snack."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9190,
      "text": "Whatever."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9253,
      "text": "You think with the invincibility I could fall even into a black hole and not die?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9339,
      "text": "Oh my gosh!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9352,
      "text": "Oh my god, oh my god, it's over!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9354,
      "text": "I'm chopped!"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9428,
      "text": "I mean, technically isn't this sending us back in the past,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9431,
      "text": "so we can keep playing,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9787,
      "text": "Don't be sad about your mama because she's a part of you."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9795,
      "text": "That means she's always close by."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9799,
      "text": "It's like me."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9800,
      "text": "I love starvets because they remind me of my mama."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9807,
      "text": "The girl said, unable to stop the tears, a lonely look flickered across Luma's face."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9821,
      "text": "I will transform into a comet."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9824,
      "text": "A soaring comet that can carry you all on this journey."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9831,
      "text": "With that, Luma trailing bands of white soared high into the sky"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9859,
      "text": "And then Luma emerged, reborn as a comet."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9873,
      "text": "Our destiny as Lumas is to transform into different things,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9877,
      "text": "said a red Luma who had suddenly appeared."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9879,
      "text": "Stars, comets, planets, we can become all of these things."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9885,
      "text": "When I grow up, I want to become a star that makes someone's special smile,"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9894,
      "text": "That Luma turned into a real cutie of a comet, didn't he?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 9901,
      "text": "All of the Lumas together said, no more crying, mama."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10063,
      "text": "What the heck?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10065,
      "text": "Galaxy 2 win?"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10066,
      "text": "I don't have Galaxy 2 and I don't know if I can even access Galaxy 2."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10071,
      "text": "Because this, this is my, it's Super Mario Galaxy, but"
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10079,
      "text": "it's, it's a part of the Super Mario 3D All-Stars, as you can see."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10088,
      "text": "Um, it's, it's not on there."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10097,
      "text": "Galaxy 2 is on Switch."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10098,
      "text": "Okay, I'll check it out then."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10101,
      "text": "But all right."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10103,
      "text": "That's, that's, that's the game."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10107,
      "text": "We've done it."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10108,
      "text": "Please look forward to Blue World releasing tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10112,
      "text": "So I'd be really, really happy if you would watch it and, and stream it lots."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10119,
      "text": "I know the video is coming out quite a bit later, but again, we put so much work into it."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10125,
      "text": "So please give it a watch and I will look forward to hearing what you guys think of it as well."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10131,
      "text": "But thank you so much for joining me for this Super Mario Galaxy playthrough."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10138,
      "text": "I hope you had a lot of fun."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10139,
      "text": "I had fun playing the game for the first time."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10141,
      "text": "It was honestly a blast."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10143,
      "text": "I really want to play my favorite Mario game though, Super Mario Sunshine."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10149,
      "text": "But I'm not sure what our next playthrough of what game, what we'll play through next."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10157,
      "text": "But thank you so much for joining me."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10159,
      "text": "Not only for this, but also for all the Tomodachi livestreams this week."
    },
    {
      "timestampSeconds": 10164,
      "text": "And yeah, I'm not sure about my schedule upcoming for next week, but for now,"
    }
